<div class="rvMliW_container"><h2 class="rvMliW_header text-heading-20 sm:text-heading-24" data-components-heading="true"><span class="rvMliW_target" id="evaluation-fallbacks"></span><a class="rvMliW_title [&amp;&gt;p]:m-0" href="#evaluation-fallbacks">Evaluation fallbacks</a><a href="#evaluation-fallbacks" class="rvMliW_permalink" aria-label="Copy link to section"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="16" width="16" data-slot="geist-icon" style="color:currentColor" class="text-[0.6em]"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a></h2></div>
<p class="my-4">Evaluation fallbacks are an AI Gateway extension to the TypeSafe request. Add one conditional object to <code class="V4tPXG_code V4tPXG_inlineCode">providerOptions.gateway.models</code> to rerun a successful but uncertain evaluation with another model.</p>
<p class="my-4">The official TypeSafe SDK forwards additional request properties at runtime, but its request type does not currently include <code class="V4tPXG_code V4tPXG_inlineCode">providerOptions</code>. Supply the extension through an intermediate object:</p>
<div class="my-4 rounded-lg group/copy relative overflow-hidden rounded-b-lg" data-agent-content="code" data-agent-filename="typesafe-evaluation-fallback.ts" data-agent-language="ts" data-geist-code-block=""><div data-section="tabs" class="py-0 pl-4 rounded-t-lg border-gray-400 bg-background-200 flex h-(--ds-size-large) items-center border pr-[5px]"><div class="gap-2 m-0 min-w-0 text-label-13 text-gray-900 mr-auto flex items-center"><div aria-hidden="true" class="w-4 flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg fill="none" height="14" viewBox="0 0 512 512" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="currentColor" height="512" rx="50" width="512"></rect><rect fill="currentColor" height="512" rx="50" width="512"></rect><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="m316.939 407.424v50.061c8.138 4.172 17.763 7.3 28.875 9.386s22.823 3.129 35.135 3.129c11.999 0 23.397-1.147 34.196-3.442 10.799-2.294 20.268-6.075 28.406-11.342 8.138-5.266 14.581-12.15 19.328-20.65s7.121-19.007 7.121-31.522c0-9.074-1.356-17.026-4.069-23.857s-6.625-12.906-11.738-18.225c-5.112-5.319-11.242-10.091-18.389-14.315s-15.207-8.213-24.18-11.967c-6.573-2.712-12.468-5.345-17.685-7.9-5.217-2.556-9.651-5.163-13.303-7.822-3.652-2.66-6.469-5.476-8.451-8.448-1.982-2.973-2.974-6.336-2.974-10.091 0-3.441.887-6.544 2.661-9.308s4.278-5.136 7.512-7.118c3.235-1.981 7.199-3.52 11.894-4.615 4.696-1.095 9.912-1.642 15.651-1.642 4.173 0 8.581.313 13.224.938 4.643.626 9.312 1.591 14.008 2.894 4.695 1.304 9.259 2.947 13.694 4.928 4.434 1.982 8.529 4.276 12.285 6.884v-46.776c-7.616-2.92-15.937-5.084-24.962-6.492s-19.381-2.112-31.066-2.112c-11.895 0-23.163 1.278-33.805 3.833s-20.006 6.544-28.093 11.967c-8.086 5.424-14.476 12.333-19.171 20.729-4.695 8.395-7.043 18.433-7.043 30.114 0 14.914 4.304 27.638 12.912 38.172 8.607 10.533 21.675 19.45 39.204 26.751 6.886 2.816 13.303 5.579 19.25 8.291s11.086 5.528 15.415 8.448c4.33 2.92 7.747 6.101 10.252 9.543 2.504 3.441 3.756 7.352 3.756 11.733 0 3.233-.783 6.231-2.348 8.995s-3.939 5.162-7.121